note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note schedrcpt.om: the scheduler-policy receipt driver of seed/node (P-DRA-14 lane). It replaces
note ~/handoffs/hive/sched/bin/receipt.py, which produced the DRA-395/396 and DRA-397 r1 receipts,
note and keeps that driver's case-file format, checks, refusals and receipt layout.
note Build (json.om appended, it supplies the JSON reader):
note   cat seed/node/schedrcpt.om seed/json/json.om | seed/out/omc > build/node/schedrcpt
note Use, from the repository root under test:
note   DRIVER_TREE/build/node/schedrcpt CASES.json OUTDIR_REL [--write]
note The source hashed into the receipt is DRIVER_TREE/seed/node/schedrcpt.om, found from argv[0].
note Exit 0 when every case passes, 1 when one fails, 2 on a driver error, 3 on a dirty tree,
note 4 on a mutant whose pattern is not unique, 5 when a gate is not the concatenation of its parts.
note
note The SHA-256 functions below are copied from om/sha256/sha256-om2.om lines 21-317 at 7f4e1a44
note (export dropped, sha256_final's digest parameter an edit instead of an out), since omc
note composes one source text and json.om is the only other part.
om2

layout shactx 104
field state uint 8 at 0 little
field count ulong at 32 little
field buf uchar 64 at 40 little
end

note ======== driver state ========
note gv: scalar slots. gl: signed slots (0 expect, 1 compile exit, 2 last run code).
note lst: nine string lists of 2048 arena indices (0 fragments, 1 compose, 2 args, 3 stdout_has,
note 4 clean, 5 mutation files, 6 mutation patterns, 7 replacements, 8 hashed files of the receipt).
note hsl: hex digests (0 source, 1 binary, 2 scratch). Run codes: 0..255 exit, -N signal N,
note 4096 timeout, 4097 no run.
const VOBN ulong 0
const VDEP ulong 1
const VSAN ulong 2
const VSON ulong 3
const VLN ulong 4
const VKPN ulong 5
const VKSN ulong 6
const VWDN ulong 7
const VCWN ulong 8
const VPBN ulong 9
const VPKN ulong 10
const VPKC ulong 11
const VPASS ulong 12
const VFAIL ulong 13
const VSRCN ulong 14
const VFBN ulong 15
const VTMO ulong 32
const VREP ulong 33
const VOM2 ulong 34
const VCN ulong 35
const VGATE ulong 36
const VWALL ulong 37
const VNRUN ulong 38
const VFDO ulong 39
const VFDE ulong 40
const VCASP ulong 41
const VOUT ulong 42
const VDRV ulong 43
const VBIN ulong 44
const VHEAD ulong 45
const VTREE ulong 46
const VTISS ulong 47
const VTSTA ulong 48
const VTCAS ulong 49
const VOK ulong 50
const VNOUT ulong 51
const VPLAT ulong 52
const NONE ulong 4294967295
const CTMO long 4096
const CNONE long 4097

